; NexusBackup: 7444/tcp is the backup agent port (docs/agent-protocol.md).
; portcon is not allowed in a refpolicy (.te) module; CIL modules may carry it.
; Needs nexus.pp (defines nexus_agent_port_t) loaded first.
(portcon tcp 7444 (system_u object_r nexus_agent_port_t ((s0) (s0))))
; 902/tcp is the ESXi NFC service (VADP network mode, crate vmware); the base policy has only the 512-1023
; hi_reserved_port_t range for it. Needs nexus.pp (defines nexus_nfc_port_t) loaded first.
(portcon tcp 902 (system_u object_r nexus_nfc_port_t ((s0) (s0))))
